results/**/*.jpg
results/**/*.jpeg
results/**/*.svg
results/**/*.pdf

# The canonical results table is the one artifact that has to be shared
# between machines -- training is split across two of them and the final
# comparison needs every row in one file. Scratch and per-run CSVs stay
# ignored; merge incoming rows with scripts/merge_results.py.
!results/experiments.csv
